{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>Twins將於12月18至23日將於灣仔會展舉行《Twins Side by Side》演唱會，英皇駿景酒店即日起全面化身應援大本營。大堂全天候輪播歷年經典金曲與冷門好歌，為歌迷打造專屬凝聚空間。酒店更突發推出極具紀念價值限量獨家收藏品與限定餐飲，背後隱藏着令人意想不到特殊驚喜。</p>\n<h2>加購咖啡奶茶特飲呼應Twins合拍默契</h2>\n<p>這次企劃處處展現出對組合出道多年來合拍程度致敬意涵。同場加映雙重奏Duo特飲將香濃咖啡與經典奶茶結合，雙管齊下一次過滿足兩個願望，完美呼應兩位成員多年來無可取代合拍默契。樂迷只需以HK$38跟餐加購價即可品嚐這款特飲，若選擇外賣專享價則為HK$58，數量有限售完即止。</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17945676059779598_14519193956af6edb6a7bc0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-6\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17945676059779598_14519193956af6edb6a7bc0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：大會提供）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179456760778997394_18201984526af6edb83432b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-2\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179456760778997394_18201984526af6edb83432b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>紀念卡及卡套。（圖片來源：大會提供）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>主廚首創雙主菜致敬Twins組合</h2>\n<p>為了配合這次應援企劃，酒店地下Monkey Café由即日起至12月23日誠意呈獻演唱會限定雙重奏咖哩套餐。主廚為向兩位偶像致敬，巧妙地將國際咖喱館兩款人氣經典合二為一。套餐包含香濃滑順錫蘭白咖哩配軟殼蟹與香料層次豐富東印度巴基斯坦咖哩雞，打造成雙主菜黃金組合，交織出合拍味蕾雙重奏。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179456760990383152_8309419416af6edba4aa87.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-5\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179456760990383152_8309419416af6edba4aa87.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>自 1984 年開業的本地著名『國際咖喱館』早前正式進駐 Monkey Café。在蘇師傅的精湛手藝與獨門咖喱粉秘方加持下，這股香濃惹味的地道港式咖喱傳奇得以延續，繼續為無數香港人帶來令人難忘的味蕾回憶。（圖片來源：大會提供）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>英皇駿景酒店全天候播Twins經典金曲</h2>\n<p>餐廳和酒店現場全天候無間斷播放Twins多首耳熟能詳大熱作品及精選曲目。除了聽覺享受之外，酒店特別推出一系列極具紀念價值限量應援周邊產品，當中包括限量版匙卡、匙卡套以及專屬設計限量明信片，供粉絲親身到場珍藏留念。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179456761140060747_11251202146af6edbbae983.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-4\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179456761140060747_11251202146af6edbbae983.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：大會提供）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2></h2>\n<h2>惠顧208元套餐免費獲贈Twins限量紀念品</h2>\n<p>整個應援企劃最具吸引力焦點落在套餐隨附獨家禮遇之上。食客凡於推廣期內惠顧定價每位HK$208雙重奏咖哩套餐，即可免費獲贈演唱會限定紀念品乙份。這項專為粉絲而設優惠活動每日供應數量有限，大會提醒所有餐飲收費需另設加一服務費，活動至12月23日正式完結。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17945676131106687_16548152216af6edbd83435.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17945676131106687_16548152216af6edbd83435.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Twins「雙重奏」DUO雙重奏咖喱套餐（圖片來源：大會提供）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T11:20:26.861062+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1134,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T11:00:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T11:34:12.463543+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T11:13:52.159689+00:00","content_hash":"4bde5dfbb88d3d51e6c5606ac1d7884c12d94753c977c51f4ab59c8e647cdddf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}